%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 612
%%Title: Ten Boats Home, page 9: where is Grandpa?
/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 109 def } ifelse  Seed srand
(lib/cb_book.ps) run
cb-ground
/fog cb-light
220 cb-harbour-sky
% the boats, half swallowed: only their sail tops show above the fog
/cb-face -1 def
[ [330 250 16] [390 256 14] [450 248 16] [505 254 14] [560 250 16] ]
0 1 4 { /i exch def dup i get aload pop cb-sails i get cb-boat } for pop
/cb-face 1 def
220 30 sub 300 0.8 cb-fog
-9 700 60 150 cb-pier
0 600 0.45 cb-fog
% the old lamp's post, at the right, the lamp unlit on its hook
newpath 588 60 14 430 cb-rect cb-wood-c 0.75 shade 3 array astore 0.8 cb-wash
newpath 600 482 moveto 470 482 lineto cb-wood-c 0.75 shade setrgbcolor << /Width 9 /Pressure { pop 1 } >> pkribbon
/cb-lit false def 500 478 46 cb-lantern
% Mama right behind her, a hand on her shoulder
5 -16 520 cb-mama
/cb-worry true def 150 60 380 cb-ana /cb-worry false def
cb-ink cb-rgb
(The fog swallows the boats. It swallows the pier. \252Where is Grandpa?\272 Ana whispers.) 56 584 500 /center cb-text pop
9 cb-folio
showpage
